&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
	&lt;ol&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;
		&lt;ol&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;What is this PR for?&lt;br/&gt;
    After #1815 was merged, &lt;br/&gt;
    ```&lt;br/&gt;
    uncaught TypeError: this._isNumeric is not a function&lt;br/&gt;
        at ColumnSettings._numericValidator &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;as validator&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; (handsonHelper.js:172)&lt;br/&gt;
        at handsontable.js:5181&lt;br/&gt;
    ```&lt;br/&gt;
    is shown when click &quot;Numeric&quot; in the result table like below. &lt;br/&gt;
    &amp;lt;img src=&quot;https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/10060731/21749365/d1d700ee-d5e0-11e6-9f25-65ebb3ea313a.gif&quot; width=&quot;450px&quot;&amp;gt;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ol&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ol&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;    Since ES6 no longer supports autobind for `this`, seems it needs to be bound in the constructor.&lt;/p&gt;


